## Summary

Implement the `close()` method for graceful server shutdown.

## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] `close(options?: CloseOptions): Promise<void>` method
- [ ] Force-expire disconnected sessions first:
  - Call `this.sessions.expireStale(0)` to expire all disconnected sessions
- [ ] Graceful shutdown (default):
  - For each connection, attempt `router.close()`
  - Race against timeout (default 5000ms)
  - Force close if timeout expires
